    preview: "Watch: 'Scariest night' as Ukraine fails to intercept Russian attack Twenty-one people were killed and dozens have been injured after Russia fired 115 drones and 24 ballistic missiles in Ukraine. Many of the drones were intercepted, but Kyiv's depleted air defences meant many of the missiles were not. Anastasiia Dudley's home was significantly damaged in the attack, which she said was the \"scariest night\" of the war. The BBC's Dan Johnson visited Anastasiia's home near Kyiv to see the extent of the damage and the emotional toll on residents.",
    body: "Watch: 'Scariest night' as Ukraine fails to intercept Russian attack\n\nTwenty-one people were killed and dozens have been injured after Russia fired 115 drones and 24 ballistic missiles in Ukraine.\n\nMany of the drones were intercepted, but Kyiv's depleted air defences meant many of the missiles were not.\n\nAnastasiia Dudley's home was significantly damaged in the attack, which she said was the \"scariest night\" of the war.\n\nThe BBC's Dan Johnson visited Anastasiia's home near Kyiv to see the extent of the damage and the emotional toll on residents.\n\nRelated topics\n\n- War in UkraineUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- RussiaUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- UkraineUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- EuropeUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.",
